 through immersive virtual reality experiences. Explore science, history, and technology inside fully interactive 3D worlds \u2014 conduct virtual lab experiments, examine detailed models, travel to historical sites, and understand complex concepts through hands-on simulations. Designed for students and teachers, the app makes learning engaging, visual, and memorable. With guided lessons, quizzes, and realistic environments, STiXR transforms traditional education into an exciting, interactive journey.", "short_description": "STiXR is an immersive learning app that transforms complex subjects into interactive 3D experiences. Explore science, history, and technology through virtual labs, realistic environments, and engaging simulations. Perfect for students and teachers, the app makes learning visual, hands-on, and unforgettable. Step into a new world where education becomes exploration."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vbmetaverse.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VB Group", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vbmetaverse.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27317205534615595"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617775_871075329209126_2405311718905242024_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_b